hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24080","Narrated to us Abd al-Razzaq and Ibn Bakr, they said: narrated to us Ibn Jurayj, he said: Ibn Shihab narrated to me that Safwan ibn Abdullah ibn Safwan narrated to him, from Umm al-Darda, from Kab ibn Asim al-Ashari. Ibn Bakr said: Ibn Asim, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Not of righteousness is fasting in travel."
"24081","Narrated to us Sufyan, from al-Zuhri, from Safwan ibn Abdullah ibn Safwan, from Umm al-Darda, from Kab ibn Asim al-Ashari, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Not of righteousness is fasting in travel."
